From: Prospero Win contributors <prospero-win@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] user32: opt in to an independent shared window-style section

Keep server style authority and ordinary fallback. Use a fixed, independently
versioned read-only section without changing Wine protocol961, window_shm_t,
ntdll or win32u. Reserve at most eight mapping attempts atomically. Retire
records before owner-thread detachment and handle reuse. Full native/SDK/PE
and console semantics/performance gates remain separate requirements.

